  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v.v.2.1.16\n    - Added: Namespace whitelist feature - configure allowed namespaces via `namespaces=` in mdk.ini\n    - Templates now include `namespaces=IngameScript` by default\n\nv.2.1.15\n- Fixed: Separator bug where Mdk-IgnorePaths only accepted '|' but props files used ';'\n- Fixed: Analyzers now read ignore patterns directly from mdk.ini and mdk.local.ini files\n- Changed: ini files are now exposed as AdditionalFiles to analyzers\n- Improved: Ignore path separators now accept ';', '|', and ',' for maximum compatibility\n\n2.1.14\n    - Whitelist update\n\nv.2.1.13\n    - Fixed broken whitelist\n\nv.2.1.12\n    - Whitelist update\n\nv.2.1.11\n    - Package updates\n    \nv.2.1.10\n    - Strange whitelist failure causing ImmutableArray to be considered illegal\n\nv.2.1.9\n    - Package was not defined as a development dependency\n\nv.2.1.8\n    - SE 1.204 Update\n\nv.2.1.7\n - Fixed harmless warnings\n\nv.2.1.4\n - Legal crap, version parity\n\nv.1.0.0\n - Initial Release",
